\begin_layout Standard
Bio7 has a light and a dark default theme (
\series bold
Bio7 Light
\series default
 and 
\series bold
Bio7 Dark
\series default
) and 
\series bold
custom themes
\series default
: a custom theme is based on the light or dark default theme and defines the colors of the workbench (the windows, views, tabs, toolbars, editors, the console and the widgets), the fonts, the style of the view tabs, an artwork image which fades over the main toolbar (and optional the view tab rows) and the colors of the icons. Several example themes are shipped with Bio7: Silver and Azure Glass (light), Slate, Graphite, Aurora, Modern Midnight, Nightshift, Ocean, Ocean Waves and Stars.
\end_layout

