\begin_layout Standard
The Git plugin of Eclipse (EGit) can be installed with the update manager: its update site (EGit) is preconfigured in Bio7. Open 
\series bold
Help > Install New Software...
\series default
, select the EGit update site and the plugins. After the installation the Git functions are available with a graphical user interface (e.g., the Git perspective, 
\series bold
Team
\series default
 in the context menu of a project). For the documentation please visit 
